WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760
Speaker 1: In a truly shocking and disturbing&nbsp;
move, the Texas attorney general is demanding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:13.680
that the state's health department release a list&nbsp;
of all transgender people in the state by asking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:21.600
for a list of those who have requested changing&nbsp;
their sex on documents. This has sparked outrage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:27.480
among not only the LGBT community, but also their&nbsp;
allies, people like me, who see it as a blatant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:34.080
attack on the rights and the privacy of trans&nbsp;
individuals. The Washington Post has a report.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:42.000
Texas AG's office cites state data on trans Texans&nbsp;
employees at the Texas Department of Public Public&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.520
Safety in June received a sweeping request from&nbsp;
Republican Attorney General Ken Paxton. His office&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:54.840
compile a list of individuals who changed their&nbsp;
gender on their Texas driver's license and other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.840 --> 00:01:04.260
department records during the past two years. Now,&nbsp;
why does the AG claim they need this? They say we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:12.420
need this list to defend a state law that requires&nbsp;
people to use bathrooms that correspond with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:19.260
gender on their birth certificate. But it's very&nbsp;
obvious what this is. This is a thinly veiled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:27.420
attempt to start generating a list which could be&nbsp;
used to target. It could be used to harass trans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:34.680
people. The attorney general is using this pretext&nbsp;
of we've got to defend law and order in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:41.940
gather information, personal information about&nbsp;
trans people in the state. Now, I don't want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:50.820
be hyperbolic or dystopian here, but we should&nbsp;
understand history and the right loves to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:57.900
about camps. They say Obama is going to put you in&nbsp;
a FEMA camp bombing or you know, they talk about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:02.940
camps. They're obsessed with camps and rounding&nbsp;
people up and all of that. We should understand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:07.500
and I'm not saying that's the direction this is&nbsp;
going in Texas, but we should just understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:13.560
historically what have been the steps that are&nbsp;
taken before actually putting people in camps or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:18.660
overtly starting violent actions against groups of&nbsp;
people? Like if that's what you were planning to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:23.160
do, what would be on the list of things that would&nbsp;
we would want to watch out for? And this is where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:30.420
history is actually very important to understand.&nbsp;
Historically, what you see in the lead up to an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:36.840
attempt to go after a population, whether it's&nbsp;
for discrimination or enslavement or genocide or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:41.580
whatever. Right. It's a big spectrum of what one&nbsp;
might plan to do. Here are some of the steps. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:47.400
you don't always see all of these. Incitement of&nbsp;
hatred and violence against a group. So this can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:53.040
include using propaganda to make people angry&nbsp;
at that group. Look. Look at what the right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.840
has been doing when it comes to trans people&nbsp;
and trans sports and bathrooms and so-called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:03.240
predators and pedophiles for years now. Okay.&nbsp;
So use propaganda and other tactics to demonize,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:10.080
dehumanize and direct anger so that hostility goes&nbsp;
up and willingness to do violence goes up against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:15.240
a particular group of people. That's happening&nbsp;
with trans people, no doubt about it. Economic and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:20.820
social discrimination. So the targeted group might&nbsp;
