00:03:56.760 --> 00:04:01.560
They don't want it to be. That's another&nbsp;
aspect. And then as things escalate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:05.700
you might see systematic violence against a group.&nbsp;
The targeted group could be subjected to physical&nbsp;&nbsp;

